  "notes": "Adds Header Layout controls. Enable Resizable Header to reveal a height slider/number field and a draggable handle on the bottom edge of the preview header; dragging changes the header heading height in normal document flow so everything below is pushed down instead of overlapped. Adds a Hide Archive of Our Own Branding checkbox that hides the AO3 heading/logo branding while preserving the customizable header area. Both settings are saved, exported to AO3 CSS, included in Concepts / Starters snapshots, and work with Falling Angle and other starters. Keeps all prior tools."
